// The three survival scenes on Friday evening. Every run reaches Wrong by Friday, so they have no tier variant.
// A line tagged #speaker:intern is the Intern's. Every other line belongs to the scene's main person, listed above each knot.

// Pan Zbigniew. Launch Team goodwill is higher.
=== survival_launchTeam ===
There you are. Our survivor. The whole team is so proud. #id:survival.survival_launchTeam.1
The launch goes ahead on Monday. Thanks to people like you. #id:survival.survival_launchTeam.2
Thank you, Pan Zbigniew. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_launchTeam.3
Rest this weekend. Sit somewhere comfortable. We will know you are well. #id:survival.survival_launchTeam.4
Biooro. Listening to your body, one flush at a time. #id:survival.survival_launchTeam.5
-> END

// Pani Halina. Paper Trail goodwill is higher.
=== survival_paperTrail ===
Sit. Not that chair. You know that by now. #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.1
It has been decided that you are retained. By whom is not recorded. #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.2
Your file is complete. Every Task, every hour, every answer. #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.3
Is that good, Pani Halina? #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.4
It is complete. That is better than good. #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.5
If Head office asks, the file will show that you were warned. Initial here. #id:survival.survival_paperTrail.6
-> END

// The Intern. Both goodwills are equal.
=== survival_equal ===
Friday evening. I made it. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_equal.1
Pan Zbigniew thinks I'm on his side. Pani Halina thinks I'm on hers. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_equal.2
Nobody quite trusts me. Nobody has fired me either. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_equal.3
On my way out, the seat in the staff toilet says goodbye. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_equal.4
It says "See you on Monday". I never told it I'd be back. #speaker:intern #id:survival.survival_equal.5
-> END
